WEBVTT

00:09.280 --> 00:10.530
Hold it right there!

00:50.080 --> 00:52.480
My fish!

01:04.060 --> 01:04.830
Hold it, little girl.

01:05.870 --> 01:07.370
Stealing is a bad thing.

01:07.790 --> 01:11.180
Don't you dare touch me with your filthy fingers!

01:11.180 --> 01:15.330
Eating something you haven't paid for is a crime called "petty theft".

01:15.330 --> 01:15.660
You must-

01:15.660 --> 01:16.930
Are you an octopus?

01:16.930 --> 01:20.340
The apples are set in front of the shop begging to be eaten by me!

01:19.370 --> 01:20.860
Cat ears?

01:20.340 --> 01:23.300
This has to be an offering to
the Goddess Kyouka no matter how you look at it!

01:23.300 --> 01:27.140
And yet, demanding money for that is a misconception.

01:23.300 --> 01:24.850
And a tail...

01:27.140 --> 01:32.650
Besides, who are you? You think you can get away without identifying yourself?

01:27.140 --> 01:29.350
It's wagging side to side,

01:29.350 --> 01:32.650
but it isn't actually part of her, is it?

01:32.650 --> 01:37.450
Plus! You curse me as a "little girl";
me, the great and holy Kyouka-sama?!

01:37.450 --> 01:40.110
I am twenty years old right now!

01:40.590 --> 01:41.570
Twenty years old?

01:42.110 --> 01:44.390
It's twenty times 365 days.

01:44.390 --> 01:46.610
I can't do mental math! Don't make me do it!

01:46.610 --> 01:49.570
20 times 365 is 7300.

01:49.570 --> 01:50.960
And I'm not an octopus.

01:51.550 --> 01:52.750
I am...

01:52.750 --> 01:57.630
Great Japanese Empire Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures, 1st Counter Department, squad captain,

01:57.630 --> 01:59.760
Midarezaki Ouka.

02:00.200 --> 02:02.420
Midarezaki Ouka?

02:02.420 --> 02:04.610
Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures?

02:04.610 --> 02:08.170
Yes, we deal with paranormal phenomena that the police can't handle,

02:08.170 --> 02:12.150
such as being cursed by ghosts or being abducted by UFOs.

02:12.150 --> 02:15.330
My organization handles cases like those.

02:15.330 --> 02:18.230
But I also have an obligation to stop you.

02:19.480 --> 02:22.020
I see, so it's you.

02:22.020 --> 02:23.820
There she is!

02:25.100 --> 02:25.910
What?

02:25.910 --> 02:27.540
So they caught up.

02:27.540 --> 02:28.810
What did you do?

02:28.810 --> 02:33.910
I was doing what you described as petty theft over and over, and their number kept increasing.

02:35.410 --> 02:36.570
Die.

02:36.570 --> 02:39.630
Suffer, moan, and accept God's judgment.

02:39.750 --> 02:41.920
Virus mail sent!

02:41.920 --> 02:42.880
What did you do?

02:42.880 --> 02:45.760
Don't worry. I only tweaked their central nervous systems a bit.

02:48.180 --> 02:52.380
Take me to where the Head of Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures is right now!

04:39.410 --> 04:41.430
This is a huge building.

04:41.430 --> 04:44.180
How bold for a mere human belonging.

04:54.010 --> 04:55.050
Sorry to make you all wait!

04:55.580 --> 04:56.950
I'm late!

04:57.470 --> 04:59.040
What do you think you're saying?

04:59.040 --> 05:02.560
They're all very important people who no one can usually talk to.

05:02.560 --> 05:05.200
You. Watch what you say.

05:06.930 --> 05:09.900
Thank you very much for coming this far.

05:11.220 --> 05:12.910
Thank you very much.

05:13.820 --> 05:16.730
Thanks to getting lost, I had an interesting encounter.

05:16.730 --> 05:18.200
He's the one, right?

05:18.200 --> 05:19.560
Midarezaki Ouka.

05:19.560 --> 05:20.720
It is him.

05:21.620 --> 05:22.370
Ouka-kun.

05:22.370 --> 05:24.960
Um, Department Chief, what is going on?

05:24.960 --> 05:28.960
Great Japanese Empire Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures, 1st Counter Department, squad captain, Ouka!

05:28.960 --> 05:29.720
Yes!

05:30.020 --> 05:32.560
I hereby give you a grave mission.

05:33.370 --> 05:35.770
This mission means saving the Earth.

05:35.770 --> 05:37.760
If you should fail,

05:37.760 --> 05:41.200
it's safe to assume that the humanity will perish.

05:39.490 --> 05:41.200
This building is really huge.

05:41.680 --> 05:47.360
Since I have been put in place, I, Midarezaki Ouka, will do my best to take on the mission.

05:41.690 --> 05:43.460
How very cocky of humans.

05:45.770 --> 05:48.140
Hey, I'm sleepy!

05:48.140 --> 05:50.320
I knew you would say that.

05:48.880 --> 05:50.890
You guys talk for so long.

05:50.890 --> 05:53.000
Godspeed to you!

05:55.860 --> 05:57.480
Marriage Recognizance?

05:57.480 --> 05:58.510
Yes.

05:58.990 --> 06:02.250
Your mission is to get married to her!

06:02.850 --> 06:05.220
Um, I fail to comprehend.

06:05.220 --> 06:07.090
Wasn't my mission to save the Earth?

06:12.250 --> 06:20.880
Kyouka, do you take this man to be your husband, to have and to hold, from this day forward, for better for worse.

06:20.880 --> 06:23.050
Sure, I do!

06:23.050 --> 06:24.260
Huh?

06:24.260 --> 06:25.640
Ouka.

06:25.640 --> 06:26.760
Forget about him.

06:27.010 --> 06:30.100
I said, "I do"!

06:31.230 --> 06:34.160
Then, sign the Recognizance.

06:41.600 --> 06:47.070
Rejoice! You are now the luckiest man alive!

06:55.050 --> 06:56.120
New house?

06:58.880 --> 07:00.590
So this is what a human's...

07:00.590 --> 07:02.590
...what a commoner's life is like!

07:06.260 --> 07:09.060
I've done lots of research, too.

07:09.060 --> 07:13.310
Let's have the ceremony all newlyweds have, shall we?

07:13.780 --> 07:14.430
Eh?

07:17.930 --> 07:23.320
I heard the new wives of this world make food for their husband.

07:22.200 --> 07:23.180
Oh, food...

07:23.320 --> 07:27.450
If you eat my cooking, your cheeks are bound to fall off.

07:27.450 --> 07:32.370
Therefore go to a famous monster's den, show 'em
a crappy dance, and have them give you an extra cheek!

07:33.220 --> 07:34.120
PLACEHOLDER

07:33.220 --> 07:34.850
I'm bored.

07:34.120 --> 07:37.110
Newlyweds you may be, but you two will not be alone.

07:35.430 --> 07:36.770
Almost done?

07:36.770 --> 07:38.800
Hello, pigs!

07:37.110 --> 07:38.070
PLACEHOLDER

07:38.070 --> 07:42.400
You will be forming a family along with five children.

07:39.370 --> 07:41.800
Stop ignoring your Kyouka-sama!

07:42.400 --> 07:42.860
PLACEHOLDER

07:42.700 --> 07:44.500
Hey, I'm getting sleepy!

07:42.860 --> 07:46.630
Therefore your role is that of husband and father.

07:46.630 --> 07:47.340
Father?

07:47.340 --> 07:48.130
Hey, Hubby!

07:48.900 --> 07:50.800
Lunch's ready.

07:51.220 --> 07:53.760
A wife like her and children to come, as well?

07:51.220 --> 07:53.760
You shall dance away and rejoice like some clowns!

07:54.220 --> 07:58.720
Are you all right with the fact you were forced to marry me, since you don't know anything about me?

07:58.720 --> 08:00.310
I did accept the matter.

08:00.930 --> 08:05.970
That's why I'm cooking and trying to fulfill my role as wife.

08:08.150 --> 08:13.660
If you're part of the Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures, you know the Legend of Enka, don't you?

08:09.920 --> 08:12.750
Ah, hey wait. Stop. Really, stop it.

08:12.750 --> 08:16.030
Crap, stop spinning. My eyes are spinning.

08:13.660 --> 08:15.160
The Legend of Enka...

08:16.030 --> 08:19.380
A monster named Enka existed a thousand years ago.

08:20.190 --> 08:24.890
No one knew if it was a god or demon,
but it tried to kill everything of this world.

08:24.890 --> 08:31.420
However it fell to humans uniting and having swords stabbed along the entire length of its body.

08:31.950 --> 08:34.890
But Enka didn't die quietly.

08:35.530 --> 08:37.670
As it was about it die, it screamed,

08:37.670 --> 08:39.600
"You humans who have slain me!

08:39.600 --> 08:47.410
In a thousand years from now, my child shall come to this world and spread fear and despair amongst you all!"

08:47.410 --> 08:51.980
And a thousand years from then,
the Child of Enka has been confirmed.

08:52.710 --> 08:56.070
Rather, that child is me, Kyouka-sama.

08:56.070 --> 08:57.230
Huh?

08:59.570 --> 09:04.820
But, there were other Children of Enka other than me.

09:05.210 --> 09:09.000
Enka's flesh was preserved in some ruins,

09:09.000 --> 09:14.100
and upon running a DNA analysis upon it,
the Children of Enka were found one after another.

09:14.920 --> 09:21.130
Killing them all would work, but that's a little too violent, so a new proposal was born.

09:21.130 --> 09:24.740
And that is the mission given to you,

09:24.740 --> 09:27.050
called "Operation Cozy Family."

09:28.060 --> 09:29.160
Why don't you eat me already?

09:32.980 --> 09:34.690
Operation Cozy Family?

09:35.070 --> 09:38.300
The general idea is to stick
all the Children of Enka together,

09:38.300 --> 09:40.570
make them live with one another while monitoring them all,

09:40.570 --> 09:44.450
and wait to see if the one will show hints, so they can decide who to kill.

09:44.450 --> 09:49.460
So the five children we will meet are the remaining Children of Enka.

09:49.460 --> 09:53.020
Obviously, it is your mission to identify who is the one and eradicate that individual.

09:53.020 --> 09:54.730
How is this "cozy"?

09:54.730 --> 09:55.250
You never know.

09:55.250 --> 10:00.880
If you get along with her, the one might find the world to be a nice place and think twice about destroying it.

10:00.880 --> 10:03.180
I can't imagine it working out like that.

10:03.230 --> 10:05.970
Enka is the one that wanted the world to end.

10:05.970 --> 10:10.560
The best thing to do is make the one forget about the parent's ideals.

10:15.910 --> 10:16.480
You.

10:17.220 --> 10:19.440
Do you not cherish your life?

10:21.480 --> 10:22.490
Eat it.

10:24.810 --> 10:28.970
This dangerous Child of Enka must be you.

10:29.270 --> 10:32.010
I will forgive your disrespect today.

10:32.010 --> 10:36.830
If I killed you, I wouldn't be able to play this game!

10:37.360 --> 10:40.460
So that's why you're making me wear these.

10:40.940 --> 10:43.570
Gathering the family in a conventional manner would be boring.

10:43.570 --> 10:48.260
So Kyouka-sama, she who seeks enjoyment in life, thought, "Why not make this into a game of hunt-the-child?".

10:48.260 --> 10:51.930
Our children are scattered around the city with these armbands.

10:51.930 --> 10:55.040
We're settling this by who finds more children.

10:55.040 --> 10:58.520
But in the documents we got, we didn't have pictures or profiles of the children.

10:58.520 --> 11:01.150
Don't worry, you pessimist equivalent of a prime minister.

11:01.150 --> 11:02.980
That is why we have these child radars.

11:02.980 --> 11:04.750
Child radar?

11:04.750 --> 11:11.120
They're amazing radars tuned to the specific wavelength emitted by the armbands and let us know their locations.

11:11.120 --> 11:14.690
As a side note, I made the Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures make these.

11:14.690 --> 11:20.800
Those guys, if I gave an order, would even make a pyramid like the slaves that worked for pharaohs without complaint.

11:24.510 --> 11:28.310
These red dots are where we are now, right?

11:28.310 --> 11:32.300
The scan radius is only 200m? That's pretty small.

11:32.300 --> 11:33.240
Nya!

11:41.690 --> 11:43.810
So, which child should I start with?

11:43.810 --> 11:47.320
It's pretty clear that I'll lose this match.

11:47.870 --> 11:51.700
No ones are more boring than those who state the obvious.

11:51.700 --> 11:54.310
I'm playing the game, so of course I'll win.

11:54.310 --> 11:57.340
And you obviously exist to play the loser role.

11:57.740 --> 11:59.900
The deadline is five o'clock.

11:59.900 --> 12:03.270
The winner can order the loser to do one thing.

12:03.900 --> 12:10.210
By the way, when I win, I've decided that you will spend your life like a dog for a week.

12:10.210 --> 12:11.840
Any answer you give will be "bark, bark!"

12:11.840 --> 12:13.620
Your food will be bones.

12:13.620 --> 12:15.440
Your room will be a doghouse.

12:16.520 --> 12:18.010
It'll be so much fun.

12:18.010 --> 12:20.380
I can't lose this no matter what.

12:23.940 --> 12:26.140
A Child of Enka is here?

12:27.370 --> 12:29.090
Where? Where is it?

12:32.240 --> 12:35.780
Um, um. Would you be Dad?

12:39.780 --> 12:41.160
I'm sorry...

12:41.160 --> 12:43.020
I mistook you for the wrong person!

12:43.020 --> 12:45.030
Wait, I am the right person.

12:46.670 --> 12:51.920
I'm the one who's fulfilling the father role of Operation Cozy Family, Midarezaki Ouka.

12:52.420 --> 12:54.630
Saying it out loud makes this sound so ridiculous.

12:55.100 --> 12:58.520
Oh, thank goodness. I thought I was wrong.

12:58.520 --> 13:00.290
I was simply puzzled.

13:00.290 --> 13:01.640
It's because you looked so normal.

13:01.640 --> 13:05.330
And I wasn't expecting to be approached by the child.

13:05.880 --> 13:07.060
I'm relieved.

13:07.060 --> 13:10.670
Because of that, my life just stretched and shrunk like an elastic band.

13:11.090 --> 13:12.980
It's nice meeting you, um...

13:13.840 --> 13:14.810
I'm Yuka.

13:15.210 --> 13:17.150
Midarezaki Yuka.

13:17.150 --> 13:18.560
Midarezaki...

13:18.560 --> 13:21.030
Oh, I see.

13:21.030 --> 13:23.200
Obviously, since we'll be a family.

13:23.590 --> 13:25.450
Yuka, I hope we get along.

13:29.170 --> 13:30.790
Touch!

13:32.250 --> 13:33.000
What was that?

13:33.650 --> 13:35.200
What's with this, "Touch!"?

13:35.200 --> 13:37.100
Now I have one and you've got none.

13:37.100 --> 13:38.660
You mean one for me and none for you.

13:38.660 --> 13:39.970
I'm the one who found Yuka.

13:40.610 --> 13:42.720
You're totally an idiot, aren't you?

13:42.720 --> 13:46.240
"To find" is totally a subjective matter.

13:46.240 --> 13:51.770
It's only fair to judge when there's a plain, objective fact, such as touching where anyone would go, "Oh, right".

13:53.810 --> 13:58.380
You have no right to talk about fairness to judge when you act like you're the rulebook!

13:58.860 --> 14:03.490
You don't have to snatch a child I found. You have your high-grade radar.

14:03.490 --> 14:06.620
Thanks to the high-grade radar, things are easy for me.

14:06.620 --> 14:09.950
So I decided to take a detour and observe your troubled face.

14:09.950 --> 14:12.630
Why didn't we look for them together in the first place, then?

14:12.630 --> 14:14.460
Oh, "together", you say?

14:14.460 --> 14:15.040
What?

14:15.040 --> 14:19.960
I understand how you're enchanted by my beauty
and don't wish to be apart from me for even a split second.

14:19.960 --> 14:22.360
Saying anything to this person is useless.

14:22.360 --> 14:25.080
But I heard how everything starts is important between married couples.

14:25.080 --> 14:29.850
So I have to set in stone who is the one to rule and who is the one to be ruled.

14:31.390 --> 14:33.260
No, Yuka. You haven't done anything wrong.

14:33.260 --> 14:34.960
Oh, so you're already into father mode?

14:34.960 --> 14:37.000
What an easily affected simple mind.

14:37.000 --> 14:38.360
It's a compliment.

14:38.360 --> 14:40.980
You keep that up and look after Yuka.

14:40.980 --> 14:42.770
Where are you going?

14:42.770 --> 14:44.240
Off to catch the next child!

14:44.240 --> 14:45.880
Adios!

14:46.610 --> 14:49.650
According to the radar, I should find one here...

14:49.650 --> 14:50.950
What could she look like?

14:52.830 --> 14:53.950
I see, she must be it.

14:54.490 --> 14:55.560
O-Ouka!

14:55.560 --> 14:57.790
I knew this was that case.

14:57.790 --> 15:00.700
You have the children's data with you.

15:00.700 --> 15:04.080
Gosh, your persistence exceeds mine.

15:03.050 --> 15:04.080
Gekka?

15:04.870 --> 15:05.420
This is...

15:05.420 --> 15:08.010
Wow, that's a nice pink color.

15:09.010 --> 15:12.560
That's not a human no matter how you look at it.

15:11.440 --> 15:13.530
Jellyfish.

15:12.560 --> 15:15.110
Jellyfish or UMA, it doesn't matter.

15:12.560 --> 15:15.110
UMA = Unidentified Mysterious Animal

15:15.110 --> 15:17.140
Give her a hug like a father!

15:22.450 --> 15:23.930
Dad!

15:23.930 --> 15:26.770
It'd be boring if the game was settled easily.

15:30.140 --> 15:33.670
I feel bad for you, Yuka,
that someone like her is the mother.

15:33.670 --> 15:35.560
But just wait a little bit more.

15:35.560 --> 15:39.490
I'll end this mission swiftly and disband this fake family soon enough.

15:39.830 --> 15:41.170
I don't want that.

15:44.630 --> 15:47.710
I was looking forward to this a little.

15:48.070 --> 15:49.060
Yuka?

15:49.510 --> 15:50.650
That's all.

15:50.650 --> 15:51.760
Please don't worry.

15:51.760 --> 15:54.240
What am I saying?

16:10.320 --> 16:12.620
Are they my children?

16:12.620 --> 16:14.920
Drop your sword, Black Warrior.

16:14.920 --> 16:17.330
I do not wish to harm a sibling.

16:17.990 --> 16:21.030
Dad, are they our family, as well?

16:21.030 --> 16:22.730
You mustn't look.

16:22.730 --> 16:24.330
Let's act like we didn't see this.

16:23.590 --> 16:25.130
I like fun things.

16:25.130 --> 16:26.930
You look very strong.

16:26.930 --> 16:29.270
I enjoy breaking people like that.

16:29.270 --> 16:30.840
That's how I was created.

16:30.840 --> 16:31.590
"Created"?

16:32.570 --> 16:33.340
That's right.

16:33.340 --> 16:37.270
I'm a biological weapon created using Enka's flesh.

16:37.800 --> 16:40.350
The first name I was given was...

16:40.760 --> 16:42.350
Black Thirteen.

16:42.840 --> 16:44.380
I was called by number.

16:44.810 --> 16:47.320
But from today, apparently I'm Hyouka.

16:47.320 --> 16:49.230
The kanji for it is complicated, so I don't know it.

16:49.940 --> 16:51.970
What's your name?

16:51.970 --> 16:53.110
Teika.

16:53.500 --> 16:56.770
"Tei" as in "king" and "ka" as in "cross"!

17:02.580 --> 17:03.990
Stop this, Hyouka!

17:03.990 --> 17:07.500
Teika is right! It's foolish for siblings to harm each other.

17:07.500 --> 17:09.130
Drop your sword right now.

17:12.170 --> 17:14.060
Would you be the father?

17:14.400 --> 17:16.040
Yes, unfortunately.

17:16.520 --> 17:18.340
Fa...ther?

17:18.340 --> 17:20.270
Black Thirteen.

17:20.270 --> 17:22.190
I know about you.

17:22.190 --> 17:25.900
But you're no longer Black Thirteen, are you?

17:25.900 --> 17:27.780
You're not a biological weapon.

17:27.780 --> 17:31.230
You can live as one of the family members.

17:31.860 --> 17:32.910
Family...

17:37.050 --> 17:38.820
No, it's all a lie.

17:40.450 --> 17:44.510
To be honest, I don't know what a family is.

17:44.510 --> 17:45.720
Father?

17:46.230 --> 17:50.290
After all, I was told to become
your father only a moment ago.

17:50.630 --> 17:57.300
But, since I am involved in the mission, I will do my best to be your father and not shame anyone with what I do.

17:59.620 --> 18:03.460
So, Hyouka. Starting today, you are my son.

18:03.460 --> 18:04.300
Son?

18:04.300 --> 18:05.980
Yes. Son.

18:05.980 --> 18:08.590
Let's create a family together.

18:15.190 --> 18:16.400
What are you doing?

18:16.650 --> 18:19.860
Is it all right for me to become someone's child?

18:19.860 --> 18:22.240
Put your sword away, first.

18:22.240 --> 18:27.810
Is it all right for me to live in a family,
surrounded by a father, mother, and siblings?

18:28.200 --> 18:29.200
It's fine!

18:29.200 --> 18:29.790
Or rather,

18:30.660 --> 18:32.710
we never know unless we try!

18:32.710 --> 18:35.080
I won't have to hurt anyone anymore?

18:35.080 --> 18:37.280
I won't have to break things anymore?

18:37.280 --> 18:39.840
So stop breaking things and hurting others!

18:44.280 --> 18:45.340
Dad!

18:45.340 --> 18:46.220
Stop!

18:47.590 --> 18:48.690
That's enough!

18:52.440 --> 18:53.760
Kyouka?

18:55.690 --> 18:57.380
Mom!

18:57.380 --> 18:58.400
Mother?

19:01.570 --> 19:02.650
Rest assured.

19:03.070 --> 19:04.570
As a most wonderful fact,

19:05.270 --> 19:08.070
I, Kyouka-sama, am omnipotent!

19:08.070 --> 19:10.240
Divine punishment!

19:15.000 --> 19:16.130
Why?

19:16.130 --> 19:17.140
Listen well.

19:18.120 --> 19:23.920
And if you make me repeat this, consider yourself dead.

19:23.920 --> 19:27.440
Any son raising his hand against his father is utter nonsense!

19:27.440 --> 19:28.430
Kyouka...

19:28.430 --> 19:32.430
The only one allowed to smash Ouka is his wife, Kyouka-sama!

19:34.810 --> 19:38.690
If you understand, say, "I'm sorry, Mother. I won't ever do anything like this again",

19:39.320 --> 19:42.540
and bow down and lick my shoes.

19:43.190 --> 19:46.030
Mother, isn't that a little over the top?

19:46.030 --> 19:48.990
You dare make comments against your mother?

19:48.990 --> 19:50.320
Parent and child, and husband and wife are the same thing.

19:50.320 --> 19:52.320
It's about who rules and who gets ruled.

19:52.320 --> 19:55.650
It's important to make that clear right away.

19:55.650 --> 19:58.350
I'm sorry, Mother. I won't ever do anything like this again.

19:59.120 --> 20:02.100
Let me say this, since it's bad for the children's education.

20:02.580 --> 20:05.770
Wives are not entitled to smash their husbands.

20:05.770 --> 20:07.990
That was the only choice I had.

20:07.990 --> 20:11.470
Hyouka is a biological weapon created to attack.

20:11.470 --> 20:14.760
No matter how you much you try to persuade him by saying "family" and "father",

20:14.760 --> 20:19.640
his system will tell him to kill anyone with a gun and his body responds to that.

20:19.640 --> 20:21.180
That's why I kicked away your gun.

20:22.940 --> 20:25.480
What kind of parent points a gun at his child?

20:32.870 --> 20:36.320
I don't want to hear that from a parent who makes her children lick her shoes!

20:41.450 --> 20:44.800
So this will be our house starting today?

20:44.800 --> 20:46.460
I simply love it!

20:46.990 --> 20:48.610
How old are you, Teika-kun?

20:48.610 --> 20:50.090
I'll be seven.

20:50.090 --> 20:52.000
Then that makes me your older sister.

20:52.000 --> 20:54.010
Did you guys wipe your feet?

20:57.140 --> 21:00.640
Hey, take a look at these biceps.

20:57.730 --> 20:59.050
Who are you?

21:00.210 --> 21:04.230
Oh right. We had another child to find.
I totally forgot about him.

21:06.830 --> 21:09.120
Father! Mother!

21:09.120 --> 21:10.770
He's so normal.

21:10.770 --> 21:13.610
Finally a child I can probably have a normal conversation with.

21:14.830 --> 21:16.360
Oh my gosh~!

21:16.990 --> 21:20.450
Such an attractive man as you is my father?

21:20.450 --> 21:23.800
I just had the world's happiest life fall into my hands.

21:23.800 --> 21:24.740
Gay?

21:24.740 --> 21:26.500
Ah, so nice.

21:26.620 --> 21:30.380
But, with this, I managed to win the child hunt game by one.

21:33.880 --> 21:35.590
Or so I thought.

21:35.590 --> 21:37.010
What? The game?

21:37.010 --> 21:39.770
That doesn't count.

21:40.070 --> 21:42.390
Let me ask just in case. Why?

21:42.390 --> 21:45.530
Because I am the one and only absolute being in this world.

21:45.530 --> 21:48.250
In this family, I am the rule!

21:46.930 --> 21:51.520
How should I describe this atrocious condition I'm in?

21:52.430 --> 21:54.020
Family Frenzy.

23:39.850 --> 23:40.870
Hi, this is Yuka.

23:40.870 --> 23:43.250
My name and family all changed.

23:43.250 --> 23:45.610
I wonder if I'll fit in as a Midarezaki.

23:45.610 --> 23:47.150
I'm simply worried.

23:47.150 --> 23:48.470
Yuka, you need to do the preview.

23:48.470 --> 23:49.070
Right.

23:49.070 --> 23:51.910
Next time: The Party Never Ends.

23:51.910 --> 23:53.900
Dad, what's a party?
